  "title": "Preserving presence for Apple Immersive Video: Learnings from post production",
  "description": "Learn how to protect presence throughout post production for Apple Immersive Video. The session covers how to review dailies on Apple Vision Pro, use editorial transitions to reset depth, maintain accurate spatial cues in audio, ensure proper 3D behavior for VFX, reduce visual noise, and grade toward an idealized yet natural look.\n\nThis session was originally presented as part of the Meet with Apple activity “Create immersive media experiences for visionOS - Day 2.” Watch the full video for more insights and related sessions.",
